    /// Per-request HTTP timeout in milliseconds.
    ///
    /// Overrides `fetchTimeout` / `fetch-timeout` from `.npmrc` / `aube-workspace.yaml` when set. Applied via `reqwest`'s `.timeout()` so it covers headers + body together.
